[36m(ActorModelRayActor pid=1324, ip=10.252.164.17)[0m ['  system\n你是书生·万象，英文名是InternVL，是由上海人工智能实验室、清华大学及多家合作单位联合开发的多模态大语言模型。 \n user\n\nYou should first thinks about the reasoning process in the mind and then provides the user with the answer. Your answer must be in latex format and wrapped in $...$.The reasoning process and answer are enclosed within <think> </think> and <answer> </answer> tags, respectively, i.e., <think> Since $1+1=2$, so the answer is $2$. </think><answer> $2$ </answer>, which means your output should start with <think> and end with </answer>.\nQuestion:\nThe Little Twelve Basketball Conference has two divisions, with six teams in each division. Each team plays each of the other teams in its own division twice and every team in the other division once. How many conference games are scheduled? \nassistant\n<think> To determine the total number of conference games scheduled, we need to consider the structure of the Little Twelve Basketball Conference:\n- There are two divisions, each with six teams.\n- Each team plays every other team in its own division twice.\n- Each team also plays every team in the other division once.\n\nFirst, calculate the number of games within each division:\n- Each team plays 5 other teams in its own division (since there are 6 teams and it plays each of the others twice).\n- Therefore, each team plays \\(5 \\times 2 = 10\\) games within its division.\n\nSince there are 6 teams in each division, the total number of games within divisions is \\(6 \\times 10 = 60\\).\n\nNext, calculate the number of games between the two divisions:\n- Each team plays each of the 6 teams in the other division once.\n- Therefore, each team plays \\(6\\) inter-division games.\n\nSince there are 6 teams in each division, the total number of inter-division games is \\(6 \\times 6 = 36\\).\n\nAdding these together, the total number of games is \\(60 + 36 = 96\\).\n</think> <think> The total number of conference games is calculated by considering both intra-division games (each team playing every other team in its division twice) and inter-division games (each team playing every team in the other division once). This leads to the total being 96 games.\n</think> <answer> $96$ </answer>\n</think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think><answer> $96$ </answer> </think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think></think>