[36m(ActorModelRayActor pid=1324, ip=10.252.164.17)[0m ['  system\n你是书生·万象，英文名是InternVL，是由上海人工智能实验室、清华大学及多家合作单位联合开发的多模态大语言模型。 \n user\n\nYou should first thinks about the reasoning process in the mind and then provides the user with the answer. Your answer must be in latex format and wrapped in $...$.The reasoning process and answer are enclosed within <think> </think> and <answer> </answer> tags, respectively, i.e., <think> Since $1+1=2$, so the answer is $2$. </think><answer> $2$ </answer>, which means your output should start with <think> and end with </answer>.\nQuestion:\nCompute the number $\\left( \\frac{r}{s} \\right)^3$ if $r$ and $s$ are non-zero numbers satisfying\n\\[\\frac{1}{r + s} = \\frac{1}{r} + \\frac{1}{s}.\\] \nassistant\n<think> To solve the problem, we start with the given equation:\n\\[\n\\frac{1}{r + s} = \\frac{1}{r} + \\frac{1}{s}\n\\]\nFirst, we find a common denominator for the right-hand side:\n\\[\n\\frac{1}{r} + \\frac{1}{s} = \\frac{s + r}{rs}\n\\]\nSo the equation becomes:\n\\[\n\\frac{1}{r + s} = \\frac{s + r}{rs}\n\\]\nThis simplifies to:\n\\[\n\\frac{1}{r + s} = \\frac{r + s}{rs}\n\\]\nSince the numerators are the same, we can equate the denominators:\n\\[\nr + s = rs\n\\]\nRearranging this, we get:\n\\[\nrs - r - s = 0\n\\]\nAdding 1 to both sides, we have:\n\\[\nrs - r - s + 1 = 1\n\\]\nThis can be factored as:\n\\[\n(r - 1)(s - 1) = 1\n\\]\nNow, we need to find \\(\\left( \\frac{r}{s} \\right)^3\\). Let \\(x = \\frac{r}{s}\\), then \\(r = xs\\). Substituting \\(r = xs\\) into the equation \\((r - 1)(s - 1) = 1\\), we get:\n\\[\n(xs - 1)(s - 1) = 1\n\\]\n\\[\nxs^2 - xs - s + 1 = 1\n\\]\n\\[\nxs^2 - xs - s = 0\n\\]\nSince \\(r = xs\\), we can substitute \\(r\\) back in:\n\\[\nx s^2 - xs - s = 0\n\\]\n\\[\nx(s^2 - s) - s = 0\n\\]\n\\[\nx(s^2 - s) = s\n\\]\n\\[\nx = \\frac{s}{s^2 - s}\n\\]\n\\[\nx = \\frac{1}{s - 1}\n\\]\nSo, \\(\\frac{r}{s} = \\frac{1}{s - 1}\\). We need to compute \\(\\left( \\frac{r}{s} \\right)^3\\):\n\\[\n\\left( \\frac{1}{s - 1} \\right)^3 = \\frac{1}{(s - 1)^3}\n\\]\nThus, the final answer is:\n</think><answer> $\\boxed{\\frac{1}{(s-1)^3}}$ </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> </answer> </think> 